r trading partner.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-800 text-white py-8\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">MovieTrade</h3>\n                    <p>Your premier destination for buying, selling, and trading movies with collectors worldwide.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-4\">Quick Links</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2\">\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\">Browse Movies</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\">Sell/Trade</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\">My Account</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\">FAQ</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-4\">Categories</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2\">\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\">Blu-rays</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\">4K UHD</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\">DVDs</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\">Limited Editions</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-4\">Connect</h4>\n                    <div class=\"flex space-x-4\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i></a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-yellow-400\"><i class=\"fab fa-twitter\"